  ('a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Noor-e-Sahar', 'noor-e-sahar', 'TZ-BRI-001', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'An ivory bridal ensemble lit with antique gold zardozi, like the first light of dawn.', 'Named for the light of dawn, Noor-e-Sahar is our most labour-intensive bridal piece. The raw silk shirt carries a deep border of antique zardozi, kora and dabka, framed by hand-cut tilla vines that climb towards the neckline.
